the target language is: prolog.

the templates are:
    the Antrag vollständig of *a case* is *a truth value*; scenario element.
    Bescheiderstellung holds for *a case*.

the knowledge base r4_10_notice_creation includes:

the text of the_rulemap is at "sources/notice-creation.ruml".

Bescheiderstellung holds for a case if
    the Antrag vollständig of the case is true.

scenario generated_1 is, as stated in "notice-creation.ruml" at generated_1:
    % every data point its first value
    the Antrag vollständig of case 1 is true.
    node_1 expects answers ["Bescheiderstellung holds for case 1"] and any unknowns.
    not_node_1 expects answers [].

scenario generated_2 is, as stated in "notice-creation.ruml" at generated_2:
    % dp_application_complete has no value
    node_1 expects answers [].
    not_node_1 expects answers ["it is not the case that Bescheiderstellung holds for case 1"].

scenario generated_3 is, as stated in "notice-creation.ruml" at generated_3:
    % dp_application_complete is false
    the Antrag vollständig of case 1 is false.
    node_1 expects answers [].
    not_node_1 expects answers ["it is not the case that Bescheiderstellung holds for case 1"].

query node_1 is:
    Bescheiderstellung holds for case 1.

query not_node_1 is:
    it is not the case that Bescheiderstellung holds for case 1.

